<title>UK: Pension misselling firms have much more to do-UK.</title>
<headline>Pension misselling firms have much more to do-UK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 24 UK companies whose progress on compensating victims of the misselling of personal pensions is being monitored by the government have &quot;a great deal more work to do&quot;, Treasury Minister Helen Liddell said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The volume of cases cleared is extremely disappointing,&quot; she said in a parliamentary written answer.</p>
</text>
